2025.description:
This project aims to refactor the firebase/quickstart-ios to demonstrate the latest Firebase AI Logic features, including multimodal analysis, function calling, and grounding context.

The key contributions are:
	1.	Rebuilt Main UI;
	2.	Integrated ConversationKit;
	3.	Supported Multimodal Analysis;
	4.	Modular feature+example design.

This project will provide complete examples of using Gemini on iOS, making the quickstart not only quick to run but also easy for new developers to understand and reuse—significantly lowering the learning curve.
